cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this harness or a snapshot it produced, please cite it as below."
title: "Islands of Stability harness"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Encarnação"
    given-names: "Robert"
version: "1.0.0"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://islandsofstability.com"
abstract: >-
  One agent, one fixed task, a two-axis sweep of tool count against injected tool-fault
  rate, with sampling error and rerun jitter measured first and one pre-registered verdict
  per proposition. The repository holds the harness, the task, the pre-registration and the
  reviewer's verification command.
keywords:
  - AI agents
  - tool use
  - fault injection
  - pre-registration
  - reproducibility
